```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your Email - HDR Health Management</title>

    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f7fb;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #172033;
      }

      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 45px 20px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 18px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      }

      /* Header */
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e, #0d9488);
        padding: 32px 35px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .logo {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 58px;
        height: 58px;
        line-height: 58px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
        border-radius: 16px;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .brand {
        margin: 14px 0 0;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      }

      /* Content */
      .content {
        padding: 42px 40px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        color: #0d9488;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: #111827;
        font-size: 30px;
        line-height: 1.25;
        letter-spacing: -0.7px;
      }

      .intro {
        margin: 0;
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      /* OTP Section */
      .otp-section {
        margin: 30px 0;
        padding: 26px 20px;
        background: #f0fdfa;
        border: 1px solid #ccfbf1;
        border-radius: 14px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .otp-label {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        color: #475569;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .otp {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 15px 26px;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #99f6e4;
        border-radius: 10px;
        color: #0f766e;
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 9px;
        line-height: 1;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.08);
      }

      .expiry {
        margin: 14px 0 0;
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .expiry strong {
        color: #334155;
      }

      /* Security Notice */
      .security {
        margin-top: 24px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        background: #f8fafc;
        border-left: 4px solid #0d9488;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .security-title {
        margin: 0 0 5px;
        color: #334155;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .security-text {
        margin: 0;
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .closing {
        margin: 28px 0 0;
        color: #64748b;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .footer {
        padding: 24px 35px;
        background: #f8fafc;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer-brand {
        margin: 0 0 7px;
        color: #334155;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .footer-text {
        margin: 0;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .wrapper {
          padding: 20px 12px;
        }

        .header {
          padding: 28px 20px;
        }

        .content {
          padding: 32px 24px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 25px;
        }

        .otp {
          font-size: 25px;
          letter-spacing: 7px;
          padding: 14px 20px;
        }

        .footer {
          padding: 22px 20px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
          <div class="logo">H</div>

          <p class="brand">HDR Health Management</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Account Security</p>

          <h1>Verify Your Email</h1>

          <p class="intro">
            Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>, we received a request to verify
            the email address <strong><%= email %></strong> for your HDR Health
            Management account.
          </p>

          <!-- OTP -->
          <div class="otp-section">
            <p class="otp-label">YOUR VERIFICATION CODE</p>

            <div class="otp"><%= otp %></div>

            <p class="expiry">
              This verification code will expire in
              <strong><%= expirationMinutes %> minutes</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Security Notice -->
          <div class="security">
            <p class="security-title">🔒 Keep your code secure</p>

            <p class="security-text">
              Never share this verification code with anyone. HDR Health
              Management will never ask you to provide your OTP through phone
              calls, messages, or other channels.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="closing">
            If you didn't request this email verification, you can safely ignore
            this message. Your account will remain secure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
          <p class="footer-brand">HDR Health Management</p>

          <p class="footer-text">
            © 2026 HDR Health Management. All rights reserved.<br />
            This is an automated security email. Please do not reply.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
```
